section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW6741gFWUPTHEiaMduBcPyyhibNuhCId9Y7rXj01MqaZc3aNuk8OQvjx9A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>一、报名要求</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW6741gFWUPTHEiaMduBcPyyhibNuhCId9Y7rXj01MqaZc3aNuk8OQvjx9A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW6UQiaWWDk5Kx3BggD26qwFnChwEgbBe3FyXc5ZylLzP1cXGzpeRZR73A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>招生对象</span></span></p><p><span><span>就读于集成电路科学与工程、电子科学与技术、电子信息等专业，对先进通信领域集成电路关键技术、人工智能芯片关键技术、生物芯片关键技术、器件、EDA等研究方向有浓厚研究兴趣的2027届本科毕业生，且</span></span><span><strong><span><span>本科前三学年学习成绩专业排名前30%</span></span></strong></span><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW6741gFWUPTHEiaMduBcPyyhibNuhCId9Y7rXj01MqaZc3aNuk8OQvjx9A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>二、活动安排</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW6741gFWUPTHEiaMduBcPyyhibNuhCId9Y7rXj01MqaZc3aNuk8OQvjx9A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW61tMT49ujDHOicN622padsgJsIecLXXSHf4r4mzYuKHkJia2BuMmFmecA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 活动时间：2026年7-8月；</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>2. 活动形式：以课题组为单位进行交流活动，导师与学生双向自由沟通，可直接与心仪导师一对一交流，充分展示学术潜力与研究方向。报名前建议联系意向导师。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 经费支持：课题组将为异地学校学生提供部分差旅补贴（深圳地区高校学生原则上不提供）。具体报销规定请以各课题组为准。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 导师简介：详见https://sme.sustech.edu.cn/index/teacher/teschers/id/2.html</span></span></p><p><span><span>*活动安排以最终公布为准，请大家持续关注。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW6741gFWUPTHEiaMduBcPyyhibNuhCId9Y7rXj01MqaZc3aNuk8OQvjx9A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>三、报名方式及申请材料</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW6741gFWUPTHEiaMduBcPyyhibNuhCId9Y7rXj01MqaZc3aNuk8OQvjx9A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW6CpAkCc31icQ4M0nfZI3Xv9nUszQ9GzFkIYvQSp8kAlzp5N6oDDdXzVQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1. 网上申报：</span></span></span><strong><span><span>即日起至2026年6月21日23:59</span></span></strong><span><span>，请注册登录研究生招生服务系统（https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/，推荐使用chrome、360浏览器），点击“全国优秀大学生交流营”  选择深港微电子学院进行在线报名，申请者需在网上报名系统注册登录，并按照要求提供本人各项真实信息。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 申请材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1）南方科技大学2026年交流营申请表（报名系统生成打印签字）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2）身份证正反面复印件及学生证复印件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单1份（需加盖院系或教务公章，提交扫描件），</span></span><strong><span><span>成绩单上注明所在专业的成绩排名</span></span></strong><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4）个人简历</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5）其他体现个人学术水平、综合能力的证明材料（包括但不限于英文水平证书、论文首页及获奖证书等）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>温馨提醒：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1. 申请者需在网上报名系统注册登录，并按要求提供本人各项真实信息。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span><span>需填报不超过3个意向交流导师。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW6741gFWUPTHEiaMduBcPyyhibNuhCId9Y7rXj01MqaZc3aNuk8OQvjx9A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>四、入营方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW6741gFWUPTHEiaMduBcPyyhibNuhCId9Y7rXj01MqaZc3aNuk8OQvjx9A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW6rfDp3U2QvrgaV6lJocCTWGeUvg7VibCdB4ia26NFicgofZibPaVLuFriaQQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>申请截止后，交流营评审工作小组将对申请材料进行审核。完成审核后，报名材料将发送至各导师处，导师将根据报名名单邀请优秀同学进行线上或线下会谈。请务必保持电话、邮箱等联系方式畅通。收到邀请后请及时确认回复。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/t117Yj6w7vujjzRp85uB47poBjcrcfW6741gFWUPTHE